{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27609","headline":"观杭州柘枝 · 张祜","name":"观杭州柘枝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舞停歌罢鼓连摧，软骨仙蛾暂起来。\n红罨画衫缠腕出，碧排方胯背腰来。\n旁收拍拍金铃摆，却踏声声锦袎摧。\n看着遍头香袖褶，粉屏香帕又重隈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}